    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-6-sec-3-2 ;
    values:originalText "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.  Assisting the Australian Commission for Law Enforcement Integrity  Schedule 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Law Enforcement Integrity, Vulnerable Witness Protection and Other Measures) Act 2013 Compilation date: 23/5/18 Registered: 30/5/18" ;
