    values:originalText "Insert:  (da) the disclosure is for the purposes of, or in connection with, the performance of the Integrity Commissioner’s functions relating to a corruption issue (within the meaning of the Law Enforcement Integrity Commissioner Act 2006) relating to any law enforcement agency (within the meaning of that Act);" ;
