doc:sch-2-sec-19-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "19(2) After section 15YA" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A declaration under subsection (1) may be made on the court’s own initiative or on application by or on behalf of a party to the proceeding. Orders that certain protections apply to a special witness" ;
    cof:pageNumber "12"^^xsd:integer .

concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-19-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "19(3) After section 15YA"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-19-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) In a special witness proceeding, the court may order that one or more of the following sections apply to a special witness:  (a) section 15YG (about unrepresented defendants);  (b) section 15YH (about represented defendants);  (c) section 15YI (about closed-circuit television);  (d) section 15YL (about alternative arrangements);  (e) section 15YM (about use of video recordings);  (f) section 15YO (about accompanying adults);  (g) section 15YP (about excluding people from the courtroom)." ;
    skos:definition "(3) In a special witness proceeding, the court may order that one or more of the following sections apply to a special witness:  (a) section 15YG (about unrepresented defendants);  (b) section 15YH (about represented defendants);  (c) section 15YI (about closed-circuit television);  (d) section 15YL (about alternative arrangements);  (e) section 15YM (about use of video recordings);  (f) section 15YO (about accompanying adults);  (g) section 15YP (about excluding people from the courtroom)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3262691ba36a87c0a23010bcbfcd525f2a14f54fab1f4ec2c54e6a253bb58dff" ;
    values:partOf concept:c2018c00199-sch-2-sec-19 ;
    cof:pageNumber "12"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Vulnerable adult complainant need not be involved in the vulnerable adult proceeding. Court may order application of certain sections to a special witness" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
