    skos:prefLabel "34 At the end of section 15YH"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-34 ;
    values:originalText "Add:  (2) This subsection applies to the following persons:  (a) for a child proceeding—a child witness;  (b) for a vulnerable adult proceeding—a vulnerable adult complainant;  (c) for a special witness proceeding—a special witness for whom an order under subsection 15YAB(3) is in force for this section." ;
