concept:c2018c00199-sch-3-sec-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 Application and transitional provisions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-10 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The amendments made by this Part apply in relation to authorisations made at or after the commencement of this Part. (2) The amendments made by this Part do not apply in relation to the continuous exercise of powers (within the meaning of the Maritime Powers Act 2013) begun under the Migration Act 1958 before the commencement of this Part. Note: After that commencement, an evidentiary certificate may be issued under section 236E of the Migration Act 1958 (as in force before that commencement) in relation to a boarding, or chase, begun under Division 12A of Part 2 of that Act before that commencement.  Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing amendments  Schedule 4 Main amendments  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Law Enforcement Integrity, Vulnerable Witness Protection and Other Measures) Act 2013 Compilation date: 23/5/18 Registered: 30/5/18" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The amendments made by this Part apply in relation to authorisations made at or after the commencement of this Part. (2) The amendments made by this Part do not apply in relation to the continuous exercise of powers (within the meaning of the Maritime Powers Act 2013) begun under the Migration Act 1958 before the commencement of this Part. Note: After that commencement, an evidentiary certificate may be issued under section 236E of the Migration Act 1958 (as in force before that commencement) in relation to a boarding, or chase, begun under Division 12A of Part 2 of that Act before that commencement.  Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing amendments  Schedule 4 Main amendments  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Law Enforcement Integrity, Vulnerable Witness Protection and Other Measures) Act 2013 Compilation date: 23/5/18 Registered: 30/5/18"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4932e3079d4f9b34fc687edf2b9f6cd9e4074df6d67971f3da9bdae13b2a7f48" ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Amendments apply in relation to authorisations made at or after commencement, but not continuous exercise of powers begun before commencement." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <c2018c00199.pdf> ;
    dc:source "c2018c00199.pdf, p.38" ;
