concept:c2018c00199-sch-4-sec-24 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "24 After subsection 139(2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-24 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (2A) Paragraph (1)(c) does not apply to a false customer name if the customer’s use of that name is justified, or excused, by or under a law. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matters in this subsection (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code)." ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (2A) Paragraph (1)(c) does not apply to a false customer name if the customer’s use of that name is justified, or excused, by or under a law. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matters in this subsection (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code)."@en ;
