concept:c2018c00199-sch-4-sec-233d-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "233D(2) Applications for reconsideration of decisions made by"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-233d-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A person affected by a reviewable decision who is dissatisfied with the decision may apply to the AUSTRAC CEO for the decision to be reconsidered." ;
    skos:definition "(2) A person affected by a reviewable decision who is dissatisfied with the decision may apply to the AUSTRAC CEO for the decision to be reconsidered."@en ;
