concept:c2018c00199-sch-4-sec-233e-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "233E(5) Reconsideration of reviewable decisions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-233e-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) A decision of the AUSTRAC CEO under subsection (2) has effect (except for the purposes of section 233B) as if it were made under the provision under which the reviewable decision was made." ;
