concept:c2018c00199-sch-4-sec-233f a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "233F Review by the Administrative Appeals Tribunal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-233f ;
    values:originalText "An application may be made to the Administrative Appeals Tribunal for review of:  (a) a decision of the AUSTRAC CEO under subsection 233E(2); or  (b) a reviewable decision made by the AUSTRAC CEO personally." ;
