concept:c2018c00199-sch-5-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 Subsection 4(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: International Residual Mechanism for Criminal Tribunals:  (a) means the International Residual Mechanism for Criminal Tribunals, established by United Nations Security Council Resolution 1966 S/RES/1966 (2010); and  (b) includes the organs referred to in Article 4 of the Statute of the Tribunal. Note 1: In 2013, the text of United Nations Security Council resolutions was accessible through the United Nations website (www.un.org). Note 2: The United Nations Security Council decided on 22 December 2010 to establish this Mechanism to carry out residual functions of the Former Yugoslavia Tribunal and the Rwanda Tribunal.  Assisting the International Residual Mechanism for Criminal Tribunals  Schedule 5  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Law Enforcement Integrity, Vulnerable Witness Protection and Other Measures) Act 2013 Compilation date: 23/5/18 Registered: 30/5/18" ;
    skos:definition "Insert: International Residual Mechanism for Criminal Tribunals:  (a) means the International Residual Mechanism for Criminal Tribunals, established by United Nations Security Council Resolution 1966 S/RES/1966 (2010); and  (b) includes the organs referred to in Article 4 of the Statute of the Tribunal. Note 1: In 2013, the text of United Nations Security Council resolutions was accessible through the United Nations website (www.un.org). Note 2: The United Nations Security Council decided on 22 December 2010 to establish this Mechanism to carry out residual functions of the Former Yugoslavia Tribunal and the Rwanda Tribunal.  Assisting the International Residual Mechanism for Criminal Tribunals  Schedule 5  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Law Enforcement Integrity, Vulnerable Witness Protection and Other Measures) Act 2013 Compilation date: 23/5/18 Registered: 30/5/18"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "aa2110f06a770a1dc8605f053c6066308c752e20368482804f1580f272b4c2d2" ;
    cof:pageNumber "50"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defines International Residual Mechanism for Criminal Tribunals" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
