concept:c2018c00199-sch-5-sec-827-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "827 S/RES/827 (1993); and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-827-2 ;
    values:originalText "(ii) annexed to the United Nations Secretary-General’s report S/25704 (1993) given pursuant to paragraph 2 of  Schedule 5  Assisting the International Residual Mechanism for Criminal Tribunals  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Law Enforcement Integrity, Vulnerable Witness Protection and Other Measures) Act 2013  Compilation date: 23/5/18 Registered: 30/5/18  United Nations Security Council Resolution 808 S/RES/808 (1993); and  (b) for the Rwanda Tribunal—the Statute of the Tribunal annexed to (and adopted by) United Nations Security Council Resolution 955 S/RES/955 (1994); and  (c) for the International Residual Mechanism for Criminal Tribunals—the Statute of the Mechanism in Annex 1 to (and adopted by) United Nations Security Council Resolution" ;
    skos:definition "(ii) annexed to the United Nations Secretary-General’s report S/25704 (1993) given pursuant to paragraph 2 of  Schedule 5  Assisting the International Residual Mechanism for Criminal Tribunals  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Law Enforcement Integrity, Vulnerable Witness Protection and Other Measures) Act 2013  Compilation date: 23/5/18 Registered: 30/5/18  United Nations Security Council Resolution 808 S/RES/808 (1993); and  (b) for the Rwanda Tribunal—the Statute of the Tribunal annexed to (and adopted by) United Nations Security Council Resolution 955 S/RES/955 (1994); and  (c) for the International Residual Mechanism for Criminal Tribunals—the Statute of the Mechanism in Annex 1 to (and adopted by) United Nations Security Council Resolution"@en ;
